<translate>
==== ReplaceOnDeplete ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Used for Drainable items. Specifies the item that the original item will be replaced with when depleted.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
ReplaceOnDeplete = PaintbucketEmpty,
</syntaxhighlight>
